This repository is the inference library. Model weights are published separately
and keep their own licence.

The encoder follows the published Metro-ASR Macaron design
(https://github.com/MohammedAly22/metro-asr, MIT): RMSNorm, rotary attention,
SwiGLU, squeeze-and-excitation convolution, and an intermediate CTC head.
This implementation is independent. No Metro-ASR source files or weights are included.
